# Baseer Portfolio

Marketing CV site for Baseer. Single owner (fixed `OWNER_ID`, no login), own Neon DB, one Cloudflare Worker (Static Assets + `/api`).

- Domains: `baseer.co.uk` / `staging.baseer.co.uk` (SPA + API same origin)
- Zone: `baseer.co.uk` Cloudflare account (single-level subdomains, Universal SSL)
- npm workspaces + Turborepo only — never pnpm/yarn
- Free Cloudflare tier: no Containers, Queues, Pages, or Advanced Certificate Manager
- Canonical agent docs: `AGENTS.md`. Sync rules with `npm run rules:sync`.
